---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10yearcalendar">
  <div class="sbp10yearcalendar-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 250" role="img" aria-label="A twelve-month timeline: write rules and open the account in month 1, buy the same amount monthly, review at the end of each quarter, compare with the VN-Index in month 12.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Twelve months: set the rules once, then keep them boring</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mười hai tháng: đặt quy tắc một lần, rồi giữ cho nhàm chán</tspan></text>
      <line x1="50" y1="130" x2="853" y2="130" class="axis" />
      <circle cx="50" cy="130" r="6" class="dot" />
      <text x="50" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T1</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="123" cy="130" r="6" class="dot" />
      <text x="123" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T2</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="196" cy="130" r="9" class="dot-red" />
      <text x="196" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T3</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="269" cy="130" r="6" class="dot" />
      <text x="269" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T4</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="342" cy="130" r="6" class="dot" />
      <text x="342" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T5</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="415" cy="130" r="9" class="dot-red" />
      <text x="415" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M6</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T6</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="488" cy="130" r="6" class="dot" />
      <text x="488" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M7</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T7</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="561" cy="130" r="6" class="dot" />
      <text x="561" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M8</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T8</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="634" cy="130" r="9" class="dot-red" />
      <text x="634" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M9</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T9</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="707" cy="130" r="6" class="dot" />
      <text x="707" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M10</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T10</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="780" cy="130" r="6" class="dot" />
      <text x="780" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M11</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T11</tspan></text>
      <circle cx="853" cy="130" r="9" class="dot-red" />
      <text x="853" y="160" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>M12</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>T12</tspan></text>
      <DiagramIcon name="calendar" x={50} y={82} size={26} />
      <text x="72" y="66" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Month 1: write the five</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tháng 1: viết năm quy</tspan></text>
      <text x="72" y="82" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>rules, open the account</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tắc, mở tài khoản</tspan></text>
      <text x="50" y="198"><tspan data-lang-en>Months 1 to 12: buy the same</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tháng 1 đến 12: mua cùng</tspan></text>
      <text x="50" y="214"><tspan data-lang-en>amount on the same day</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>số tiền vào cùng một ngày</tspan></text>
      <DiagramIcon name="eye" x={415} y={204} size={26} />
      <text x="437" y="198" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Quarter-end (M3, M6, M9, M12):</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cuối quý (T3, T6, T9, T12):</tspan></text>
      <text x="437" y="214" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>review from the journal</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>rà soát từ nhật ký</tspan></text>
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={707} y={92} size={26} />
      <text x="727" y="72" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Month 12: compare the</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tháng 12: so kết quả</tspan></text>
      <text x="727" y="88" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>result with the VN-Index</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>với VN-Index</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Red dots mark the four reviews. In between, the plan asks for one action a month.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chấm đỏ đánh dấu bốn lần rà soát. Giữa các lần đó, kế hoạch chỉ đòi hỏi một hành động mỗi tháng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10yearcalendar { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10yearcalendar-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10yearcalendar figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
